UID:192678
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 94 mins (1h34m)\n\nAfter a young couple witnesses a 
 gruesome highway accident\, they soon realize they did not leave the crash
  scene alone\, as a demonic presence called the Passenger that won't stop 
 until it claims them both turns their van life adventure into a nightmare.
 \n\nDirected by André Øvredal\n\nScreen 6\n\nEstimated start: 11:45
LOCATION:Regal Bella Bottega\, 8890 NE 161st Avenue\, Redmond\, WA 98052
END:VEVENT
