BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Star Wars: The Mandalorian & Grogu
DTSTART:20260527T114500Z
DTEND:20260527T142500Z
DTSTAMP:20260527T114500Z
UID:191561
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 132 mins (2h12m)\n\nThe Mandalorian and Grogu embark
  on their most thrilling mission yet in Lucasfilm’s “Star Wars: The Ma
 ndalorian and\nGrogu\,” an all-new Star Wars adventure opening exclusive
 ly in theaters May 22\, 2026. The evil Empire has fallen\, and\nImperial w
 arlords remain scattered throughout the galaxy. As the fledgling New Repub
 lic works to protect everything the\nRebellion fought for\, they have enli
 sted the help of legendary Mandalorian bounty hunter Din Djarin (Pedro Pas
 cal) and his\nyoung apprentice Grogu. Directed by Jon Favreau\, “Star Wa
 rs: The Mandalorian and Grogu” also stars Sigourney Weaver and\nJeremy A
 llen White\, is written by Jon Favreau & Dave Filoni & Noah Kloor\, and is
  produced by Jon Favreau\, p.g.a.\, Kathleen\nKennedy\, p.g.a.\, Dave Filo
 ni\, p.g.a.\, and Ian Bryce\, p.g.a.\, with Karen Gilchrist\, John Bartnic
 ki\, and Carrie Beck serving as\nexecutive producers. The music is compose
 d by Ludwig Göransson.\n\nDirected by Jon Favreau\n\nScreen 1\n\nEstimate
 d start: 12:10
LOCATION:Regal Bella Bottega\, 8890 NE 161st Avenue\, Redmond\, WA 98052
END:VEVENT
