BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Drishyam 3
DTSTART:20260527T115500Z
DTEND:20260527T151500Z
DTSTAMP:20260527T115500Z
UID:193540
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 171 mins (2h51m)\n\nGeorgekutty is not just protecti
 ng his family from the world\, he is protecting them from the truth\, and 
 from the burden of what binds them together. Now\, as new forces begin to 
 close in\, more organized and determined than ever before\, the cracks in 
 his carefully built calm start to widen. The threat is no longer just exte
 rnal\; it presses against his conscience\, his relationships\, and the fra
 gile normalcy he has tried so hard to create. And as the walls slowly tigh
 ten around him and his family\, how much more is Georgekutty willing to sa
 crifice.\n\nDirected by Jeethu Joseph\n\nScreen 3\n\nEstimated start: 12:2
 0
LOCATION:Regal Bella Bottega\, 8890 NE 161st Avenue\, Redmond\, WA 98052
END:VEVENT
