BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Breadwinner
DTSTART:20260529T115000Z
DTEND:20260529T135000Z
DTSTAMP:20260529T115000Z
UID:189506
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 95 mins (1h35m)\n\nStarring record-shattering comedi
 an Nate Bargatze in his first feature film\, The Breadwinner stars \nBarga
 tze as salesman Nate Wilcox and Mandy Moore as his wife\, Katie. To Nate a
 nd their three children\, Katie is the \nultimate mom - she manages their 
 comically chaotic household with equal parts efficiency and love\, and eve
 rything \nruns perfectly. But when Katie’s household invention leads to 
 a once-in-a-lifetime deal on Shark Tank and takes her on \na prolonged bus
 iness trip\, Nate has to figure out how to keep the house from (literally)
  falling apart. He and his kids \nsoon learn that while he may not do it l
 ike mom\, he can figure out how to do it his way. Welcome to the dad era.\
 n\nDirected by Eric Appel\n\nScreen 2\n\nEstimated start: 12:15
LOCATION:Regal Bella Bottega\, 8890 NE 161st Avenue\, Redmond\, WA 98052
END:VEVENT
