 onvicted for killing his adopted parents and goes to jail for 13 years and
  when he comes back he loves Amrita (Amrita Rao) unaware that she is the d
 aughter of his adopted parents.\n\nDirected by Surender Reddy\n\nScreen 8\
 n\nEstimated start: 21:25
