DTEND:20260531T212500Z
DTSTAMP:20260531T180000Z
UID:193596
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 180 mins (3h00m)\n\nGautham\, a rock musician\, suff
 ers from psychological trauma and hallucinations linked to his parents’ 
 mysterious death during childhood. As he begins uncovering hidden truths f
 rom his past\, he is drawn into a dangerous conspiracy that blurs the line
  between reality and illusion. What follows is an intense psychological ac
 tion thriller driven by revenge\, mystery\, and self-discovery\n\nDirected
  by Sukumar\n\nScreen 9\n\nEstimated start: 18:25
LOCATION:Regal Bella Bottega\, 8890 NE 161st Avenue\, Redmond\, WA 98052
END:VEVENT
