 ay\, and with the fate of the free world hanging in the balance\, PRESSURE
  follows General Dwight D. Eisenhower and Captain James Stagg as they face
  an impossible choice—launch the largest and most dangerous seaborne inv
 asion in history or risk losing the war altogether.\n\nDirected by Anthony
  Maras\n\nScreen 7\n\nEstimated start: 11:55
