DESCRIPTION:Duration: 110 mins (1h50m)\n\nIn a city of humanoid animals\, 
 a hustling theater impresario's attempt to save his theater with a singing
  competition becomes grander than he anticipates even as its finalists' fi
 nd that their lives will never be the same.\n\nDirected by Garth Jennings\
 n\nScreen 10\n\nEstimated start: 11:25
LOCATION:Regal Bella Bottega\, 8890 NE 161st Avenue\, Redmond\, WA 98052
END:VEVENT
