DTSTART:20260603T110000Z
DTEND:20260603T130500Z
DTSTAMP:20260603T110000Z
UID:192562
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 99 mins (1h39m)\n\nAfter years of being sheltered fr
 om the human world\, the Turtle brothers set out to win the hearts of New 
 Yorkers and be accepted as normal teenagers through heroic acts. Their new
  friend April O’Neil helps them take on a mysterious crime syndicate\, b
 ut they soon get in over their heads when an army of mutants is unleashed 
 upon them.\n\nDirected by Jeff Rowe & Kyler Spears\n\nScreen 11\n\nEstimat
 ed start: 11:25
LOCATION:Regal Bella Bottega\, 8890 NE 161st Avenue\, Redmond\, WA 98052
END:VEVENT
