 ows General Dwight D. Eisenhower and Captain James Stagg as they face an i
 mpossible choice—launch the largest and most dangerous invasion in histo
 ry or risk losing the war altogether.\n\nDirected by Anthony Maras\n\nScre
 en 7\n\nEstimated start: 22:05
