SUMMARY:Masters of the Universe
DTSTART:20260604T152000Z
DTEND:20260604T180500Z
DTSTAMP:20260604T152000Z
UID:192688
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 140 mins (2h20m)\n\nIn MASTERS OF THE UNIVERSE\, Dir
 ector Travis Knight brings the legendary franchise back to the big screen 
 in this epic live-action adventure. After being separated for 15 years\, t
 he Sword of Power leads Prince Adam (Nicholas Galitzine) back to Eternia w
 here he discovers his home shattered under the fiendish rule of Skeletor (
 Jared Leto). To save his family and his world\, Adam must join forces with
  his closest allies\, Teela (Camila Mendes) and Duncan/Man-At-Arms (Idris 
 Elba)\, and embrace his true destiny as He-Man — the most powerful man i
 n the universe.\n\nDirected by Travis Knight\n\nScreen 2\n\nEstimated star
 t: 15:45
LOCATION:Regal Bella Bottega\, 8890 NE 161st Avenue\, Redmond\, WA 98052
END:VEVENT
