UID:192567
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 109 mins (1h49m)\n\nFrom the songs of his mother’s
  heart to the whispers of a faithful God\, David’s story begins in quiet
  devotion. When the giant Goliath rises to terrorize a nation\, a young sh
 epherd armed with only a sling\, a few stones\, and unshakable faith steps
  forward. Pursued by power and driven by purpose\, his journey tests the l
 imits of loyalty\, love\, and courage—culminating in a battle not just f
 or a crown\, but for the soul of a kingdom.\n\nDirected by Brent Dawes & P
 hil Cunningham\n\nScreen 7\n\nEstimated start: 11:25
LOCATION:Regal Bella Bottega\, 8890 NE 161st Avenue\, Redmond\, WA 98052
