DTEND:20260610T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20260610T183000Z
UID:188099
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 125 mins (2h05m)\n\nIn this hysterical comedy\, Arma
 nd and Albert have built the perfect life for themselves tending to their 
 gaudy Miami nightclub. But their pastel tranquility is shaken when Armand
 ’s son announces that he’s getting married to the daughter of ultra-co
 nservative Senator Keeley… and they’re all getting together for dinner
 ! Can Armand and Albert transform themselves into Mr. and Mrs. Family Valu
 es in time? It’ll take the performance of their lives! \n\nThis special 
 30th anniversary release includes exclusive insight from Leonard Maltin.\n
 \nFathom events do not qualify for Unlimited subscriptions.\n\nDirected by
  Mike Nicols\n\nScreen 11\n\nEstimated start: 18:55
LOCATION:Regal Bella Bottega\, 8890 NE 161st Avenue\, Redmond\, WA 98052
END:VEVENT
