 n Wayans (“Shorty”)\, Shawn Wayans (“Ray”)\, Anna Faris (“Cindy
 ”)\, and Regina Hall (“Brenda”) reunite in Scary Movie alongside ret
 urning favorites and fresh faces to slash through reboots\, remakes\, requ
 els\, prequels\, sequels\, spin-offs\, elevated horror\, origin stories\, 
 anything with the word legacy in it\, and every “final chapter” that a
 bsolutely isn’t final. Nothing is sacred. No trope survives. Every line 
