 out the Digital Circus and its history.  Will they come to terms with wh
 at they uncover\, or will they make… the other choice? Also\, presumably
  at some point someone says something funny\, because this ending can’t 
 be THAT depressing\, can it?"\n\n\nDirected by Gooseworx\n\nScreen 5\n\nEs
 timated start: 21:55
LOCATION:Regal Bella Bottega\, 8890 NE 161st Avenue\, Redmond\, WA 98052
END:VEVENT
