UID:192607
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 94 mins (1h34m)\n\nThe first full-length animated Sc
 ooby-Doo adventure for the big screen is the never-before told stories of 
 Scooby-Doo's origins and the greatest mystery in the career of Mystery Inc
 . "SCOOB!" reveals how lifelong friends Scooby and Shaggy first met and ho
 w they joined with young detectives Fred\, Velma and Daphne to form the fa
 mous Mystery Inc. Now\, with hundreds of cases solved and adventures share
 d\, Scooby and the gang face their biggest\, most challenging mystery ever
 : a plot to unleash the ghost dog Cerberus upon the world. As they race to
  stop this global "dogpocalypse\," the gang discovers that Scooby has a se
 cret legacy and an epic destiny greater than anyone imagined.\n\nDirected 
 by Tony Cervone\n\nScreen 2\n\nEstimated start: 11:25
LOCATION:Regal Bella Bottega\, 8890 NE 161st Avenue\, Redmond\, WA 98052
END:VEVENT
