 riends set sail in their biggest\, all-new\, can’t miss cinematic event 
 ever…The SpongeBob Movie: Search for SquarePants. Desperate to be a big 
 guy\, SpongeBob sets out to prove his bravery to Mr. Krabs by following Th
 e Flying Dutchman – a mysterious swashbuckling ghost pirate – on a sea
 faring comedy-adventure that takes him to the deepest depths of the deep s
 ea\, where no Sponge has gone before.\n\nDirected by Derek Drymon\n\nScree
